	(gr_text "CHRONOS J7 <-> HELIOS CAM1 ADAPTER v1\nJ1: straight 22p 0.5mm Type-A FFC to Chronos J7\nJ2: Aerium 15p-22p FORWARD cable, 22p end here\nSJ1 OPEN = supplies isolated (default)\nCheck TP1=3.3V (Chronos on) and TP2=3.3V,\nTP3=GND (Helios on) BEFORE full hookup.\nWrong reading = swap cable polarity type."
		(at 112 110.5 0)
